 =?UTF-8?q?B=20parks=20to=20the=20backend=20once=20[daveey]?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The first sidebar page whose rows carry `muted` POSTs /mute {muted: true} for
every locally parked row the backend reports unmuted, then records the profile
(per gateway) so it never runs again. A 404 leaves the local list alone; other
failures retry on the next load.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
